    "title": "Trivia Match - Quiz Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Trivia Match!\r\n\r\nTrivia Match combines the excitement of trivia with the strategy of matching games, allowing players to solve quizzes across numerous categories in a fun and engaging way.\r\n\r\nChallenge your mind with diverse trivia quizzes.\r\nLearn while you play, unlock boosters, and prove your trivia mastery. \r\n\r\nMatch & Win:\r\nChallenge your knowledge and matching abilities in a race against the clock. Match related trivia answers to conquer levels and earn epic rewards.\r\n\r\nCollect:\r\nDive into Trivia Match's global adventure, Complete trivia chapters and collect iconic landmark souvenirs.\r\n\r\nGo on an exciting journey around the world with Trivia Match.\r\n\r\nKeywords: Trivia, Trivia Game,  Trivia Quest, Trivia PvP, Trivia Live, Trivia TV, Trivia Categories, Trivia Quiz, Trivia Questions, Trivia Gameplay, Trivia Leaderboard, Trivia Challenges, Trivia Crack, Trivia Crush, Trivia Match, Logo Quiz, World Trivia Game, Guess the Logo",
